# Text is stored LF everywhere; Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Binaries, named explicitly: `text=auto` guesses, and a wrong guess plus core.autocrlf
# rewrites a video one byte shorter (it happened to two of them on 2026-10-15).
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
